type: software
repository-code: https://github.com/Brajesh31/cea
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A small repository of independent Streamlit demonstrations for candidate
  elimination, a toy sigmoid neural network, and a synthetic majority-class
  baseline. The examples are educational and are not validated for
  consequential decisions.
